  accTitle: Refs can belong to different memory spaces
  accDescr: The current Mosaic GPU quickstart distinguishes simple elementwise work through registers from staged Hopper tensor-core work through shared memory and an accumulator. A Ref’s declared memory space determines its role; Ref does not mean shared memory.
  A["Global input memory"] --> B["Registers: elementwise work"]
  B --> F["Global output memory"]
  A --> C["SMEM input tiles"]
  C --> D["Tensor cores and accumulator"]
  D --> E["SMEM output tile"]
  E --> F
